        "title": "Nightmare · ratchet",
        "kind": {
          "type": "Frame",
          "size": [
            640.0,
            138.0
          ],
          "text": "Every hard pull-out ratchets the tension up a notch, and so does every minute you stay touched. Tension lifts the floor (Limit Min 4 → 20) and the ceiling (Limit Max 22 → 36) together, so it only gets harder. The pitch lurches between 2 Hz thuds and a 100 Hz buzz on an irregular step clock; intensity jumps between 55 and 100 %. Let go for three seconds and the ratchet releases. B lurches 140 ms behind A. The Graph cap in Setup still wins."
        }
